  "observations": [
    "The six chassis follow the raised cornice drawn from the real foot-contact surface. Nest objects remain under the passage.",
    "Leth is an individual organic character with personal clothing and tools. Waiting, listening, speaking, refusal and loss are distinct asset states; no walking or boarding is invented.",
    "Refusal shows no completed testimony. A witness lost after testimony retains the recording and TE01 but is unavailable.",
    "The seized emitter leaves an empty socket; no intact powered unit remains on it.",
    "Panels separate source copies, private consent, protected progress and future witness availability. The three restitutions are gated separately by their acquired sources.",
    "Prototype contrast and composition are readable in the reviewed Canvas outputs. World labels can be occluded by the walker, while status panels remain clear."
  ],
